  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Champions of Faith",
    "summary": "During [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), as many as 3 **ADEPTA SORORITAS** units of yours can become Righteous until your next Command phase, including units [embarked](vsdata:core-rule/embarking) in a **TRANSPORT**. A Righteous unit gets these:\n\n- +1\" M for its models\n- +1 Ld for its models\n- +1 WS and +1 BS for weapons of its **PARAGON WARSUITS**, **CELESTIAN SACRESANTS**, **CELESTIAN INSIDIANTS** and **BATTLE SISTERS SQUAD** models",
